cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this implementation, please cite the paper below and identify the
  software version used.
type: software
title: "graph-dependence: split a graph-randomization drop into gain and penalty"
abstract: >-
  Trains a PyTorch Geometric model on the real graph, on degree-preserving
  randomized graphs and with no edges, and reports the gain (what the graph
  adds to the model), the penalty (what wrong edges cost it) and the drop,
  with 95% intervals paired by seed.
